    {
      "start": 4.94,
      "end": 15.98,
      "text": "there it is again a streak i swore was gone"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.24,
      "end": 29.08,
      "text": "every time i name the dark you redraw it"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.5,
      "end": 40.44,
      "text": "you arrive without a sound just a shift in gravity"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.1,
      "end": 47.44,
      "text": "loose objects start to turn like they remember you"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.94,
      "end": 54.34,
      "text": "i trace the same old arc in every word you choose"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.34,
      "end": 62.12,
      "text": "a language built on leaving and returning when it suits"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.7,
      "end": 69.1,
      "text": "you said this time it's done like a ritual you keep"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.1,
      "end": 72.7,
      "text": "i buried what you were in the shallowest of sleep"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.7,
      "end": 76.44,
      "text": "the distance has a pattern and it bends toward your need"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.44,
      "end": 80.5,
      "text": "you call it coincidence i call it orbiting me"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.5,
      "end": 86.88,
      "text": "you pass you pull you fade again a cycle dressed as accident"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.88,
      "end": 94.16,
      "text": "i learned your sky by heart still couldn't map the end"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.16,
      "end": 100.76,
      "text": "you're just a final passing out a fire i won't follow down"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.6,
      "end": 108.04,
      "text": "you lit my nights then left me blind too many times too many times"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.04,
      "end": 115.14,
      "text": "i held you like a guiding line you cut away then redefined"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.14,
      "end": 124.24,
      "text": "but even stars decay somehow you're just a final passing out"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.54,
      "end": 131.08,
      "text": "every goodbye you gave came numb but not complete"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.08,
      "end": 134.82,
      "text": "like you were testing exits you never meant to keep"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.82,
      "end": 138.52,
      "text": "you owe me speaking echoes when your silence gets too loud"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.52,
      "end": 142.1,
      "text": "when no one else will listen i'm the shadow you allow"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.1,
      "end": 145.68,
      "text": "i wore the weight of maybe like it meant something real"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.68,
      "end": 149.16,
      "text": "but hope became a habit that i finally can unfeel"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.16,
      "end": 152.58,
      "text": "you don't see the repetition from the center of your spin"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.58,
      "end": 156.52,
      "text": "but i've been counting impacts every time you reel me in"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.52,
      "end": 162.88,
      "text": "you pass you pull you fade again and i pretend it's different then"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.88,
      "end": 169.54,
      "text": "but every sky you cross leave as a me to mend"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.54,
      "end": 176.36,
      "text": "you're just a final passing out a fire i won't follow down"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.14,
